#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:46
msgid "Block groups"
msgstr "Blokgroepe"

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:23
msgid "Block type ids switched off in the dashboard: editors can no longer add them. Existing blocks of these types keep rendering."
msgstr "Bloktipe-ID’s wat in die paneelbord afgeskakel is: redakteurs kan hulle nie meer byvoeg nie. Bestaande blokke van hierdie tipes word steeds vertoon."

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:35
msgid "Block type ids switched on in the dashboard although their own configuration keeps them out of the block chooser."
msgstr "Bloktipe-ID’s wat in die paneelbord aangeskakel is al hou hul eie konfigurasie hulle uit die blokkieser."

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:69
msgid "Colour configuration"
msgstr "Kleurkonfigurasie"

#: juizi/blocks/profiles.zcml:31
msgid "Create example content to showcase the new website"
msgstr "Skep voorbeeldinhoud om die nuwe webwerf ten toon te stel"

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:22
msgid "Disabled blocks"
msgstr "Afgeskakelde blokke"

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:57
msgid "Editing language"
msgstr "Redigeertaal"

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:34
msgid "Enabled blocks"
msgstr "Aangeskakelde blokke"

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:70
msgid "JSON document holding the master colour list, the block themes built from it, and per-block allow lists."
msgstr "JSON-dokument met die hoofkleurlys, die bloktemas wat daaruit gebou is, en die toegelate lyste per blok."

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:47
msgid "JSON object mapping block type ids to the user groups that may add them. Blocks without an entry are offered to everybody."
msgstr "JSON-objek wat bloktipe-ID’s koppel aan die gebruikersgroepe wat hulle mag byvoeg. Blokke sonder ’n inskrywing word aan almal aangebied."

#: juizi/blocks/profiles.zcml:13
msgid "Juizi Blocks"
msgstr "Juizi Blocks"

#: juizi/blocks/profiles.zcml:21
msgid "Juizi Blocks: Development site"
msgstr ""

#: juizi/blocks/profiles.zcml:31
msgid "Juizi Blocks: Example content"
msgstr "Juizi Blocks: voorbeeldinhoud"

#: juizi/blocks/profiles.zcml:13
msgid "Juizi's block set (Hero, Content Row, Carousel, Gallery, Callout, Redirect) with a dashboard for colours and block switches. Needs the volto-juizi-blocks frontend add-on."
msgstr "Juizi se blokstel (Hero, Content Row, Carousel, Gallery, Callout, Redirect) met 'n paneelbord vir kleure en om blokke aan en af te skakel. Benodig die volto-juizi-blocks-frontend-byvoeging."

#: juizi/blocks/profiles.zcml:21
msgid "Set up this add-on's own development site: Volto Light Theme, its site settings, and the site title and email sender name"
msgstr ""

#: juizi/blocks/interfaces.py:58
msgid "The language of the Juizi blocks' editing interface (sidebar, hints), whatever the page's language. Empty: the page's language. Visitors always see the page's language."
msgstr "Die taal van die Juizi-blokke se redigeerkoppelvlak (sybalk, wenke), wat ook al die bladsy se taal is. Leeg: die bladsy se taal. Besoekers sien altyd die bladsy se taal."
